DESCRIPTION:Join us for casual in-gallery conversations in our special exh
 ibition\, JANE!\, facilitated by our Museum Engagement Guides. Enjoy a spo
 tlight tour focusining on a single object\, followed by an open conversati
 on. \n\nCurated by Associate Curator of European Art\, Patrick R. Crowley
 \, JANE! celebrates the aesthetic and affective excesses of Jane Stanford
 \, the Gilded Age founder and matriarch of Stanford University. Bringing t
 ogether precious keepsakes\, souvenirs\, archaeological detritus\, and spo
 oky mes\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://museum.stanford.edu/exhibitions
 /jane\nLast synced: 2026-10-16 10:11 PDT
